# Boolean thread-mate proofs — never printed or sliced, rendered by gate.sh.
# Each 'empty' part must render zero facets (the thread mates at thread_tol);
# each 'interferes' control must render non-empty (proves the check can fail).
# Both threads are SINGLE-START, so the interfering control is a HALF-lead
# (180 deg) rotation — a 90 deg control could still clear and pass vacuously.
#
# Central screw / elevator-nut pair:
fit-mate           empty
fit-mate-ctrl      interferes
# Lid / cap-nut pair (second independent tuned fit):
lid-fit-mate       empty
lid-fit-mate-ctrl  interferes
